<title>JAPAN: Japan six-year JGB auction lowest price of 100.23.</title>
<headline>Japan six-year JGB auction lowest price of 100.23.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said its auction on Friday of 500 billion yen of six-year Japanese government bonds (JGBs) produced the following results:</p>
<p>Lowest price	 100.23    Stop rate	 1.657 pct</p>
<p>Average price	100.27    Average yield   1.649 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   1.7876 trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	499.1 billion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 74.6 pct Issue date	   Jan 31, 1997   Maturity   Jan 20, 2003</p>
<p>Coupon payment     Jan 20, July 20</p>
</text>
